# Cursor Workflow

Full reference: `docs/product-framework/CURSOR_RULES.md`

**Before code:** read README, ROADMAP, HANDOFF, CHANGELOG, INTEGRATION_PLAN; confirm phase scope.

**During work:** one scoped increment; touch only required files; reuse existing modules.

**Git:** commit/push only when explicitly asked; Conventional Commits per CONTRIBUTING.md; never force-push main.

**Verify before done:**

```bash
npm run lint
npm run build
```

**Boundaries:** no engine integration unless phase requires it; no copying external repos; tokens from `src/design-system/` only.
